.TH ll 1 "FUZIX System Utilities" "FUZIX"
.SH NAME
ll \- long directory listing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ll
[\fIdirectory\fR ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ll
prints a long listing \- mode, link count, owner, group, size, date and
name \- of each
.IR directory ,
or of the current directory if none is given.
.SH OPTIONS
None.  It is a separate program rather than an alias for
.BR "ls \-l" ,
and it accepts no flags.
.SH NOTES
Every argument must be a directory.  Naming a plain file gives
.RB `` "ll: can't stat" ''
rather than a listing of that one file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ls (1)
